==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Suicune|59}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*'''Cure Stream''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Secret Wonders|Suicune|19}} from the {{TCG|Secret Wonders}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Brilliant Diamond and Shining Pearl}}.

